# Public artefact is the PDF only. Corporate template code/assets are added
# on the internal PC and must never be committed from here.
# Organiser hand-off zips are built from talk.pdf on demand: redundant with the
# tracked PDF, and a binary that would bloat history.
*.zip
_extensions/
_brand.yml
assets/
*.scss
*.css
*.pptx
*.svg
gradient_bar.png
*.html
*_files/
.quarto/
*.log
!talk.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png

# LaTeX-path leftovers. Never run `quarto render talk.qmd --to pdf` on this
# revealjs deck: it takes the LaTeX route, deletes talk.pdf and then fails.
# Build HTML, then print talk.html?print-pdf with decktape or headless Chrome.
*.tex
talk_files/
